WEBVTT

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.970
Dammit, they don't even try to
hide their hate for me, do they?

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:38.270
My leadership and management are the only
reasons this place has good numbers...

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.020
Wait, boss! Is this for real?!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.990
Of course it is. You made too much
progress on the third floor.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.740
The upper brass have
their eyes on you now.

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.280
B-But...

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.200
It's impossible! I'm gonna die!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.200
Stop whining and get to work!

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:04.040
Letter of Appointment: Kinji Ninomiya and Wanibe are to be transferred to Exploration Division Group 8, effective today

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:03.960
I mean... But... This is... Well... Yes...

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.760
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.510
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:39.800
Episode 2: An Un-ANT-icipated Encounter

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.900
Hold it together, Ninomiya!
There's no insurance if you die!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:07.460
Ninomiya! Help! Hey!
Ninomiya! Ninomiya...

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:07.460
This is seriously
such a crappy company...

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:11.840
The Raiza'ha Mining Corporation
is headquartered in Torstone.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:16.380
With a capital of 1.3 billion gold
and over 30,000 employees,

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.720
it is truly a massive company.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.680
Its main business is centered around
the industrialization of demonite,

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.180
a market that has grown rapidly
since the industrial revolution.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:30.770
This involves the logistics,
sales, research, development,

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.100
Go for infinite work!
All you need is to put in your all, do or die!

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:35.490
as well as exploration and mining
of demonite-rich dungeons.

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:39.660
Exploration, especially,
is the core of its corporate revenue.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:43.780
{=1}Mining Division

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:43.780
{=0}Exploration Division

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:44.830
It is highly specialized
and split into multiple divisions.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.410
Within the exploration division,
there are multiple groups,

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:51.000
like Group 3, in charge
of hunting large monsters

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.550
to defend and expand the mining areas.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:58.760
It is a very profitable group
and is viewed as the elite.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:10.350
Group 8, where Ninomiya
was transferred to,

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:13.520
is tasked with supporting those
who fight on the front lines.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.320
They must clean up mob monsters,

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.950
refill treasure-chest-shaped
storage boxes with support items,

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:22.740
and run other errands.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:25.240
They are viewed as dropouts.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.460
This is terrible...

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.050
Work is life-threatening,
loans are never-ending...

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:38.170
I don't need any
more salt in these wounds.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.550
Dammit...

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:43.100
I'll climb out of this, no matter what...

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:46.140
Hey, Ninomiya...

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.560
Is this how I'll end up?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:54.860
Just working until I die,
with nobody to remember me...?

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:59.860
You really can't stop filling the air
with crappy vibes, huh?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:07.540
I am absolutely determined, no matter
how much trouble I cause others,

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:11.920
to die only after living life
to the total and complete end!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:17.710
Let's wrap this up and go drinking...

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:23.050
Or... Since we can't afford it, annoy
the bartender by ordering water.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.680
Right!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.360
Who asked for these visuals?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:43.740
I-I can't breathe... I...

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:51.910
But I... Huh... That feels weird...
Ninomiya, this is weird, this is...

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:46.450
Just wait a bit...

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:51.910
Poison, sleep, paralysis... What works?

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.880
Ugh, what a bother!

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.460
Just guzzle it all!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.920
Oh no!

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.060
You idiots.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:16.190
The route I had you
two run was relatively safe.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:21.530
Well, since Wanibe won't be back
for a while, you cover his shift, too.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:22.190
Huh?

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.280
Also,

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.950
the cost of all the items you
threw into that treasure chest monster

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.990
will be subtracted from your pay.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.450
Huh?! What?! That's insane!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:36.130
Enough talk. Get back to work.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:42.510
Do Wanibe's work in addition to mine?
That's impossible.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:46.260
Even my own workload is more
than I can finish in one workday.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.890
Dammit...

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:58.190
Hmm? Where's the trash I just took out?

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.230
Did some cats steal it?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.320
What is this?

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.900
Rare delicacies!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.700
Just shut up and eat!
I know you're hungry!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.170
Something smells good.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:23.420
Hey, wait! No! Oh...

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:25.630
Meat!

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.090
No! That's...

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.850
The folks around here treat
marbled meat like trash for some reason,

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:34.430
so I was able to buy that
for super cheap! My treasure!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.600
I love meat.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.270
Stop right there!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:43.940
Everything I've done so far
is working against me...

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.240
Here are all the items I need you
to refill treasure boxes with today.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.240
Yeah.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.750
It's a lot. Good luck.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.960
Huh...

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.250
You need to be careful with this one.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.510
There are some expensive potions in here.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:07.760
They're worth around
three months of our pay.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.840
Don't, like, drop and
break them or anything.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.510
Yeah...

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.890
What is this? What is this?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.190
Just nodding along obediently
to what I'm told...

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.230
Is this really me?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.860
A torrential unknown force
of great magnitude

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:30.030
is wearing down my spiritual core...

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:35.200
I'm going to get destroyed
by this crap company!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.290
I have to do something, quickly...!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.920
Hey, what's the rush?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.920
Monsters are chasing me!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:52.390
Glad you're here.
Buy time so I can escape!

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:57.310
I'm Group 3! I'm an elite!
Just shut up and do it!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.140
Is that the proper attitude
for asking a favor from someone?

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.980
Stop with the chitchat and hurry!

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:13.410
Ants!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.910
What are those?!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.120
Dungeon ants!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.460
Well, take them out, then!
You're one of the "Elite Group 3"!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:29.340
There's obviously too many!
I got separated from my crew, too!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.590
Dive!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.220
What?!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:50.690
Oh, you got done really quick today.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.160
I need the phone!

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:57.620
You're all beat up; what happened?

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.540
"What happened"?! Sheesh!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.540
Dammit, pick up!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.920
There's a huge horde of
dungeon ants headed this way!

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:06.250
What? Dungeon ants?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.300
That's impossible. You should know that.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:12.090
Monsters are very territorial.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.680
Even though the monsters from
the deeper levels are stronger,

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.640
they still don't just haphazardly
appear in the upper levels.

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:20.470
What?! What did you say?!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:26.060
I said, I can't spare manpower on
something that can't even be verified.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.690
More importantly, have you
finished your work for the day?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.690
You've got to be kidding...
This is serious!

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.840
Dammit... Damn ants!

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:57.640
Something... There's got
to be something useful!

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:01.180
Hey, you can't treat company
equipment so roughly...

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:03.600
Something!

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:07.940
There has to be something!

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.020
Dammit... Come on...

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:36.800
Yes! It worked.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.850
The ants were also confused,
since they couldn't find us.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.140
Well, but, yeah...

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:49.860
I can't believe you put dungeon ant feet
in the transformation drug you found...

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:52.020
That was a surprise.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.320
Well, I guess that did
get us out of that jam...

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:59.870
But you're not really supposed to use
company equipment without permission.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:03.830
What are we dilly-dallying for?!
Let's get out of here!

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.330
That's not gonna happen.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.540
Huh?

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.460
That crap boss...

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:13.130
The moment he found out what was going on,
he sealed off the entrance.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.460
We were abandoned.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.880
It can't be...

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:22.100
Once the transformation
drug wears off, we're doomed.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.890
Wh-What are we going to do?!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:28.640
Just calm down. I don't want to do
something rash and die instantly.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.770
I wonder what we can do.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.530
Unable to proceed.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.200
Understood.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:46.700
Heh, that one got abandoned.
I guess we're all the same in that way.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.880
Hey, I can understand what they're saying!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.670
Of course. Though temporary,

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:57.260
we are completely transformed
into ants right now.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.970
I see...

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.680
That's good to know!

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:03.850
Hey, where are you going?!

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.350
Just watch.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.600
Are you all right?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:15.320
Nobody is coming to talk to you.
Is that normal around here?

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:20.490
Oh, pardon my bluntness.
Can you understand what I'm saying?

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:21.740
Yes.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:25.450
I'm a travelling worker ant;
name's Ninomiya.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.540
But not just any worker ant...

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:32.960
An advisor and consultant ant,
that supports worker ants everywhere.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:35.090
Support?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:41.680
Tell you the truth, my boss... I mean,
my queen was very short-sighted.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:49.430
She only cared about herself and
drove the colony to collapse real quick.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:54.650
I learned my lesson, and now I travel
around the world to help other ants

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.820
so that my tragedy doesn't happen again.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:14:00.690
So when I saw you, I got concerned.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:04.910
You might be a bit overworked;
do you understand?

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.620
Yes.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:10.910
So, how is it?
How often do you get to rest?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.540
Two out of 7 days? One out of 10 days?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.460
None.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.710
What?! No rest?!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:18.550
No.

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:23.470
Unbelievable... How could that be true...?

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.970
Then what about rewards?!

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:30.020
You work so hard, there must be some
wonderful rewards promised, right?

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.850
No.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:36.940
What?! Unbelievable!
How can your pay be so low?!

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.190
What is he doing...?

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.320
Wait, so let me get this straight.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:44.410
You're working so hard here
and are about to die from it,

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:47.870
but you aren't compensated at all,
and get no rest either?

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.200
Is that right?

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.000
Aren't you annoyed?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.540
No. Orders.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.170
No!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:02.210
There's no way you're not annoyed!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:08.350
Think about it! Your personal... I mean,
your ant life, is this what it's for?

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:09.510
No!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:13.020
You were born as a living thing, there
must be something you can or want to do...

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:15.060
Lots of things!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.190
Those things are being stolen
from you! It's not right!

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:22.610
This world should be equal,
regardless of position or rank!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:26.910
You have the right to express your
grievances towards the queen ant!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.370
Right... Equal...

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:34.460
Yes! If you have issues with your
workplace, you're allowed to express them!

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.460
Really?

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.250
Yes, really!

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:45.670
I'm actually planning on starting
a victim's gathering for ants like you.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.340
Gathering?

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:51.180
It'll help for sure.
Please, just stop by and listen!

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:53.100
Y-Yes...

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.190
I knew it! These guys are so easy!

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.900
I feel like I'm teaching a child who
doesn't know right from wrong

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:02.070
how to use a knife.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:05.740
One customer coming in!

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.490
Coming in? To where?

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:11.030
Just make this guy feel comfortable.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.280
Huh...

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.200
Hey, wait!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:17.500
Hey, there! Yes, you! Do I sense some
dissatisfaction with your workplace?

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:25.510
What?! You're injured?! That's horrible;
does your insurance cover it?!

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:30.430
Hey, you there! Yes, you! That looks
real heavy, what you're carrying.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:45.820
Fellow worker ants! The time has come!

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:50.820
Yes, the time to express our unbreakable
will of resistance against the queen,

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:54.410
who abuses her position to force us to
work in a terrible environment, is now!

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:00.540
Ninomiya! Ninomiya!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.130
First, look at this!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:10.680
So the other day, I had to go to work
from really early in the morning...

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.680
That's you, right...?

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:16.350
I can't stand watching
you all like this...

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:20.390
Ninomiya...

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:25.230
That's why I've decided,
to fight by your side!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:28.240
Ninomiya! Ninomiya!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:33.700
We must band together and improve the
standing of worker ants in ant society!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.910
Yeah!

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.120
For workers!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.160
Yeah!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:44.500
Ninomiya! Ninomiya!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:49.170
Only 30% progress on
Operation Surface Invasion?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.590
Yes...

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.390
Far too slow.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:59.350
With the cursed glutton-demon gone,

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:02.980
we finally have the chance
to expand our reign...

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:07.650
What are the worker ants doing?

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.820
Push them harder! Make them die working!

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:14.200
Ugh, what is this noise?!

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:21.160
Wh-What?
Why are you all dressed like that?!

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.870
What the...?

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:25.920
You're a worse queen than I thought.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:30.130
You make your underlings work until they
drop, yet you're relaxed on your throne?

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:34.430
Is that really how a queen
is supposed to be?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:39.890
A human?! What's going on?
Why is a human here with my ants?!

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:42.390
Because we're comrades,
fighting for a cause.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.940
What?!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.690
Isn't that right?!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:51.740
Rights? Equality?
What are you talking about?

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.860
Without me, this hive is doomed!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.410
Silence! Listen!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:03.540
It's no use. They're connected
to me with a bond of trust.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.750
I don't understand what
they're saying anymore, but...

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:10.050
I can tell they won't listen to
you anymore, after all your abuse.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:11.800
Wh-What...?

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.880
Pay attention!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:18.470
You no longer have the right to be queen!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:21.640
Right? I don't have the right?

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.730
Yeah. Or should I say, the talent.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.650
Hah, I see, human.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:30.690
You don't understand.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:36.200
A queen does not need
"rights" or "talents"...

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:45.040
What a queen needs is raw power!

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:53.170
I will eat you alive!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.300
Oh no!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.650
I'm hungry.

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.980
Hey, you're...!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.650
Rim...

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.950
Oh, food.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:27.660
Wait food. Wait food.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.990
Wait Rim! Stop!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.040
Dammit...

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.880
Take this; don't eat them!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:40.090
I'm glad I stole that meat
from the inventory depot...

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:52.980
Oh, what a hero...

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:09.120
I'm sorry about all the trouble I caused.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:13.920
I'm really sorry. Ninomiya,
you handled my workload, too, right?

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.670
Yeah, about that... Don't worry about it.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.800
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:29.560
Well, the other day, I got commended for
exterminating a bunch of dungeon ants.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:30.640
I see...

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:35.150
Um, before you continue, why are
we going deeper into the dungeon?

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:36.940
Can you believe it?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.650
They left us out to die,
but when we somehow survived,

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:44.160
all they did was give us a sheet of paper.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:49.080
Their betrayal was so smoothly executed,
I was almost impressed.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:51.040
U-Um, hey, Ninomiya...

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.500
This is already the second floor...

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.420
So that got me thinking.

00:21:54.420 --> 00:22:01.050
This crappy company needs
a great leader like me.

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.220
A what now?

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:04.140
For starters,

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:07.060
I've started an organization for taking
over Raiza'ha Mining Corporation.

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:08.560
Join us, Wanibe.

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.020
Huh?

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:13.310
The group's name is...

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:18.730
...Dungeon Black Company.
